OL,3,GNEWSAAttacks survivor praises 'amazing'
OL,4,Abrain injury charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nottingham attacks survivor who was
OL,7,Fleft with no memory of his life before
OL,8,Fthe tragedy has praised a brain injury
OL,9,Fcharity for its "amazing" support.
OL,11,FWayne Birkett, 63, was struck by a van
OL,12,Fdriven by triple killer Valdo Calocane
OL,13,F- who had been diagnosed with paranoid
OL,14,Fschizophrenia - on 13 June 2023,
OL,15,Fleaving him with a complex brain
OL,16,Finjury.
OL,18,FHe reluctantly sought support last year
OL,19,Ffrom the charity Headway Nottingham,
OL,20,Fbut said he was now "so glad" he had.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
